      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it works because the Toggle is an Adapter toggle, not a device toggle. The adapter will call `ValidateFeatureSupportedWithToggles` with the adapter toggles that are enabled, which in turn calls this method. That filters out the feature from being reported by the adapter.\n\nFWIW this is the same as what I had to do above with `SubgroupMatrix` being gated on `UseVulkanMemoryModel`.",
